<title>TUNISIA: Tunisian leasing firm ATL on bond issue.</title>
<headline>Tunisian leasing firm ATL on bond issue.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisian leasing company Arab Tunisian Lease (ATL) has launched a six million dinars seven-year note issue at a 10 percent yield, bourse sources said on Monday.</p>
<p>The issue of 600,000 notes at 10 dinars each is guaranteed by Arab Tunisian Bank, Banque Nationale Agricole, Tunisian-Kuwaiti Development Bank (BTKD), and Banque du Sud.</p>
</text>
